  - inkJsonForCutscene: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 5d8b497651da21d4cb1191b93a42bf03, type: 3}
    lettersList:
    - "Dearest Husband,\r\n\r\nI hope your life as a London journalist treats you
      well. The children and I miss you more and more with each passing day.\r\n\r\nI
      bear some bad news. The family coffers have run dry, as has the larder. I fear
      that we shall soon perish. I could send the children to the factories- they
      are of course above 10 now and of working age. But still, I fear what could
      become of them in such dangerous places. Worse yet, I fear Oliver has taken
      ill.\r\n\r\nDearest, if you have coins to spare, please send us what you can.
      We shall hold out for now, but without food, heat, or medicine- I know not
      how long we can survive.\r\nYour loving Wife,\r\nMargaret\t\txoxo"
    - 'To Mr Martin,

      Normally, I can keep my cool but tonight I''m wildin''

      I''ma
      be in a dangerous mood can you match my timing

      Telling me that you really
      ''bout it why try hide it

      Talk is cheap so show me that you understand
      how I like it

      Can you blow my mind

      Set off my whole body whole
      body

      Make me sweat

      Make me hotter

      Make me lose my breath

      Make
      me water'
    - 'To Mr Rian,

      All along it was a fever

      A cold sweat hot-headed
      believer

      I threw my hands in the air sai "Show me something"

      You
      said "If you dare come a litttle closer"

      Round and around and around
      and around we go

      Oh now tell me now tell me now tell me now you know

      Not
      really sure how to feel about it

      Something in the way you move

      Makes
      me feel like I can''t live without you

      And it takes me all the way

      I
      want you to stay'
    - Welcome to the Alpha Build
    - 'Guide:

      Use your mouse to click then enjoy the scandal!!!'
